# The four lines below stay empty until the Apple Developer account is
# active. Fill them in then; `bundle exec fastlane ios beta` will start
# uploading to TestFlight.
#
# How to find each value once the account is active:
#   apple_id    → the email you signed in with at developer.apple.com
#   itc_team_id → App Store Connect → Users and Access → bottom of the page
#   team_id     → developer.apple.com/account → top-right (10-char ID)
#
# Required env vars for the `beta` lane (set via direnv, 1Password CLI, or
# CI secrets — never commit):
#   APP_STORE_CONNECT_API_KEY_PATH    ios/fastlane/AuthKey_<KEY_ID>.p8
#   APP_STORE_CONNECT_API_KEY_ID      from App Store Connect → Keys
#   APP_STORE_CONNECT_API_ISSUER_ID   from App Store Connect → Keys

apple_id("")
itc_team_id("")
team_id("")
